{"requestId": null, "message": "{\n    \"error_type\": \"<class 'ValueError'>\",\n    \"error_message\": \"the caption model carries an adapter (Gemma4ForConditionalGeneration, active_adapters). SPEC amendment 3.13 (3) serves the NF4 BASE with the adapter OFF \\u2014 captions through a classification adapter are a third instrument and nothing in the caption file could say so.\",\n    \"error_traceback\": \"Traceback (most recent call last):\\n  File \\\"/runpod-volume/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/runpod/serverless/modules/rp_job.py\\\", line 257, in run_job\\n    handler_return = handler(job)\\n                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  File \\\"/runpod-volume/repo/scripts/serve_handler.py\\\", line 408, in __call__\\n    self.client, self.info = self.loader(config)\\n                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  File \\\"/runpod-volume/repo/scripts/serve_handler.py\\\", line 375, in _load\\n    assert_no_adapter(model)\\n  File \\\"/runpod-volume/repo/scripts/serve_handler.py\\\", line 146, in assert_no_adapter\\n    raise ValueError(\\nValueError: the caption model carries an adapter (Gemma4ForConditionalGeneration, active_adapters). SPEC amendment 3.13 (3) serves the NF4 BASE with the adapter OFF \\u2014 captions through a classification adapter are a third instrument and nothing in the caption file could say so.\\n\",\n    \"hostname\": \"ic15zi8yk1bg7b-64411646\",\n    \"worker_id\": \"ic15zi8yk1bg7b\",\n    \"runpod_version\": \"1.11.0\"\n}", "level": "ERROR"}
